rpl
------------------------------------------
A search/replace utility. rpl replaces strings with new strings in multiple
text files.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libpcre2_8_0-10.49-1
  libuchardet0-0.0.8-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gengetopt-2.23.1-1
  help2man-1.49.3-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libpcre2-devel-10.49-1
  libuchardet-devel-0.0.8-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rrthomas/rpl

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rrthomas/rpl/releases/download/v2.1.2/rpl-2.1.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack rpl-2.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./rpl-2.1.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/rpl-2.1.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/rpl-2.1.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(rpl)
  /usr/bin/rpl.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/rpl.README
  /usr/share/doc/rpl/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/rpl.1.gz

